
                                ReqIT v1.0
                                ----------

  ReqIT is nothing but another request-util. It's simply installed as any
  other pfile except for one thing. As command-lina argument the path, and
  name of the file containing your request-data, should be included. Therefor
  you can have more than one request-file, maybe for different access-groups
  or similar.

  Include in this archive should be :

    ReqIT     - The mainprogram
    ReqIt.doc - This file !

  If anythings missing, you should complain to the person who gave it 
  to you , and request from him, the complete archive.

                                Equipment.
                                ----------

    MessRewarder is compiled using SAS C v6.51 and tested on Cnet v3.05c,
    running on an 1meg chip, 2meg fast , A500. Hopefully it won't cause 
    any trouble, and however , I don't take responsibility if the program
    fucks up.
                         
                    Who's allowed to use MessRewarder?
                    ----------------------------------

     Well, anyone can use the program as they want's as long as they obey 
     the following rules :

      1./  You must be REGISTRATED user of C-Net.

      2./  You may not alter ANYTHING in neitherthe executebles nor the  
           doc'files.

      3./  If you gonna spread the tools , you MUST have all the files 
           in it's original archive, and it's strictly forbidden to charge
           any money for it.

     If you follow these rules, everything is OK!


